  "limits": [
    "This repeat did not reproduce a combined-profile-only UDP regression. The initial combined run remains separate evidence. Loss in this repeat matched socket-buffer drops. Checksum, length, incomplete-header, and no-socket deltas were zero.",
    "The larger-buffer pair changes both test endpoints and does not qualify a system buffer default.",
    "Whole-board sampled CPU includes stock Plasma and test process startup and teardown. Normalization uses received payload bytes. CPU interrupt time and EQOS interrupt counts are separate measures.",
    "EQOS rates use CPU6 counts bracketing each flow. Small boundary traffic can enter those counts. No interrupt count increase was observed on the other CPUs.",
    "The runs are short and use one physical board and peer. They do not establish total TX CPU savings or qualify a global profile."
  ],
